    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if the world's first real cult...never actually disappeared?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, Kyra receives a mysterious email that changes her life forever. By replying, she tumbles into an adventure that begins in the colourful crashes of London, onto the winding depths of Beijing's back-alleys and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mithra</strong></i><strong> is a 2D hand-drawn narrative mystery where forgotten gods, urban labyrinths and conspiratorial puzzles collide in a modern myth you live through.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD TO GET LOST IN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Kyra, a young girl from Brixton, South London, whose ties to the ancient group run deeper than she ever thought possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she falls deeper down the rabbit-hole, Kyra must unravel the truth about her past and make choices that will determine her fate and the world's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/e0f51698d840736cd43c9769bd8402f5.poster.avif?t=1754562952\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/e0f51698d840736cd43c9769bd8402f5.webm?t=1754562952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/e0f51698d840736cd43c9769bd8402f5.mp4?t=1754562952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES WITH PERSONALITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered, narrative-driven puzzles \u2013 from audio riddles to cryptic codes.\u00a0Each puzzle type offers a distinct tone, mechanic, and emotional feel that works in tandem with the rest of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street-level prophets, hooded archivists, creepy bridal shop owners: every encounter deepens the mystery and the relationships you forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared - <strong>it will get weird.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/80210deb73478831d613640aefacd3af.poster.avif?t=1754562952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/80210deb73478831d613640aefacd3af.webm?t=1754562952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/80210deb73478831d613640aefacd3af.mp4?t=1754562952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STUNNING HAND DRAWN WORLD &amp; FULLY ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in unique, textured environments deliberately crafted to invite <strong>exploration and evoke emotion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered &amp; adaptive audio soundscapes that features a <strong>completely bespoke soundtrack</strong> to draw you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/58e56ce0f2f11235cdf28ef9bb1c4c8d.poster.avif?t=1754562952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/58e56ce0f2f11235cdf28ef9bb1c4c8d.webm?t=1754562952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705650/extras/58e56ce0f2f11235cdf28ef9bb1c4c8d.mp4?t=1754562952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Conspiracy:</strong> Uncover a secret cult that\u2019s shaped history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand\u2011Drawn Art:</strong> Stylised, richly detailed 2D environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Puzzles:</strong> Environmental, logic, and audio-based brainteasers - that's just the start!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Global Adventure:</strong> London, Beijing &amp; more \u2013 all with their own secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Ambience:</strong> A soundtrack and sound-design reacting to your moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> Dialogue choices shape revelations and relationships.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY TO JOIN?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PATER TE EXSPECTAT...</i></p>",
